# ne-report.timer — run ne-report.service daily at 01:00 Europe/Vienna, 3 h after the 22:00 contrib prewarm (srv/contrib.go contribWarmHour/contribNightHour) filled the RAM stash; ~225 KGs × 45 s ≈ 2.8 h at CPUQuota 100 % → settled before 04:30, no CPU spike during the day.
[Unit]
Description=Daily NE epoch reports (siedler → umfeld-at)

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 01:00:00 Europe/Vienna
RandomizedDelaySec=15min
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
